    {
        "text": "<p=1>Wilderness, Central Governorate, Ursus</>",
        "tag": "animtext",
        "id": "at1",
        "name": "group_location_stamp",
        "style": "avg_only_heavy",
        "pos": "-400,-200",
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "animtextclean"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... Kal'tsit is dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "text": "The name that Chairman Witte extracted from the Chernobog lab files is no longer of use.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You're looking for Kal'tsit.;Why?",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because of the Sarcophagus, of course. Ursus needs its energy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You know where it is?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know the specifics, unfortunately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "But Witte gave you a name: Kal'tsit.;He wanted you to find Kal'tsit through us.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Witte trusts you.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. Otherwise, he wouldn't have sent me alone\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sent me to the Far North alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, he trusts me. It's the duty of a soldier to follow orders, and it's not my place to complain, even if I should die in the Far North.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it shouldn't be this way. Miners and civilians were massacred, but the Grand Duchess gets out unscathed, and the Army is able to deploy a stone's throw from Grypherburg with no consequences.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't how things should be! How can I go back like this...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Lieutenant Gorchekova.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "If I told you, there was a way to bring Kal'tsit back to life...;What would you do?",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you joking? How is that possible? Is this Kal'tsit like the fae of legend, able to return to life whenever she wants?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait a moment. The Chairman did say that the secret police <i>once</i> believed Director Kal'tsit to have died in that incident...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "text": "You just tell me like that? Did you think I would trust you the same way in return? You're not even Ursine\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1730_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What if some of us used to be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raidian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1730_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if you really do know nothing, we won't forget that you once stood with us there, helping evacuate the Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raidian"
    },
    {
        "text": "We appreciate what you did, Lieutenant Gorchekova, even if you don't need our thanks. Am I right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raidian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1730_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me, and I'll listen, once again as a child of Ursus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raidian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I knew I couldn't resist the chance to awaken a straying Ursine's identity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I know about the Sarcophagus is very limited...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
