    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1984_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Lieutenant?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Witte"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry. I think I got distracted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1984_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright. Bad habits of the elderly. I can't stop myself when I start talking about the motherland and our future with the youth...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Witte"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1984_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps you really do need rest. I've taken up too much of your time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Witte"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1966_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Your High Excellency, I was simply thinking about what you said\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eloysius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1984_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get some rest, Lieutenant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Witte"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unlike the Far North, Grypherburg still sees some daylight this time of year. Do not forget to finish your report, once you've rested.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Witte"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
