    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'As the mines begin to reopen gradually in the Northern Tundra, the Third Army casts its gaze towards the Central Governorate.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'The Fourth Army continues its illegal presence on the border of the Central Governorate. All citizens are advised to respect the cordon and refrain from traveling to the Lake Neva area.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'The First Army has begun to conscript students from dozens of universities in the Central Governorate, without authorization from the State Council. Student protests across the country are being bloodily suppressed.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'The Second and Seventh Armies have been mobilized, in response to Grypherburg's request...'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside",
        "volume": 0,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "cr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "channel": "cr",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's all you see in the papers these days. I've got a cousin going to school in the Central Governorate. Haven't heard from her in a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Student A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you hear? Uchitelnitsa Koshelna didn't go to Deity Grypherburg Imperial University. She went to the mines to teach the miners how to read!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Student B"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's so brave and selfless of her. I want to follow in her footsteps when I graduate...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Student B"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope we'll see her again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Student B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't listen to everything you read in the papers! It's all bad news to make us anxious and demoralize us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Student C"
    },
    {
        "text": "The student council is holding a protest in Igor Memorial Park. Are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Student C"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Student B"
    },
    {
        "text": "M-Me too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Student A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "cr",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
