    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_197_poca_1#4",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_405_absin_1#1$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a lot of movement in the military. Student and worker strikes are taking place all across the country, but they're being suppressed even swifter and more harshly than before...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also, the Grypherburg police recently arrested a student from the Literature Department attempting to graffiti the grand hall of the State Council. I heard the Petrachevsky Group is soliciting donations and trying to get him released.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_405_absin_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's true, I checked with them. Every underground tabloid is spreading the news about him, and the words he wrote on the walls of the council hall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Absinthe"
    },
    {
        "text": "The underground tabloids are printing far quicker than the censors can keep up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Absinthe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_197_poca_1#4",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's put that in the next letter to Sonya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_197_poca_1#3",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "They should be on their way back to Grypherburg, come to think of it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_405_absin_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Write anyway. There are curfews everywhere. There's no guarantee they'll make it back on schedule.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Absinthe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "char_197_poca_1#3",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes... I hope things go smoothly on their side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_405_absin_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "They will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Absinthe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
