    },
    {
        "text": "Getting in wasn't that hard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worker?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just because I hacked the monitors doesn't mean you can let your guard down. They say the session has been suspended indefinitely, but they could also resume at any time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice in Earpiece"
    },
    {
        "text": "The corridor leading to the meeting hall is still being patrolled four times an hour. Not counting the time it takes to get out, you have eight minutes to leave your mark.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice in Earpiece"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pee? Break something and take a piece?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worker?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Can you do something that doesn't make so much noise and actually means something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice in Earpiece"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... I'll think about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worker?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do I have to dress like this, anyway? It's not like my normal clothes are all that conspicuous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worker?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're wearing a Grypherburg plumber's uniform. They don't have a seat on the council, but they have access to the council hall, and they're responsible for maintenance work throughout the building.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice in Earpiece"
    },
    {
        "text": "While there's no way for students like us\u2014complete non-producers\u2014to gain access to the council, much less gain any real influence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice in Earpiece"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bah, why am I even explaining all this to you? I'm hanging up. You have six minutes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice in Earpiece"
    },
    {
        "text": "Botani out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice in Earpiece"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1979_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Lokh</i>.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worker?"
    },
    {
        "text": "What should I do? Six minutes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worker?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "The student in the plumber's uniform casts his gaze towards the end of the council hall, where the symbol of Ursine divine glory shines bright on the wall."
    },
    {
        "text": "He thinks for a moment, then squints and pulls out a can of red spraypaint."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
