        "inverse": true,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Brekin is not on duty today, but his colleague, who lives next door to him, sent his youngest son to his place and asked him to take his shift today, because he had a fever and a splitting headache."
    },
    {
        "text": "Brekin, being the kind-hearted man he is, agreed. Scarcely could he imagine what he would see when he walked into the council hall\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_groceriespaper",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_ceramicrack",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Gosudar-batyushka</i>\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cleaner"
    },
    {
        "text": "The golden symbol on the wall is fully covered in red paint. Beneath it are words written with the same red paint, in the Ursine language\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
